{"title":"1993 AHSME Problems/Problem 17","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1993_AHSME_Problems/Problem_17&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/a/6/ba646966f2f2a41a55ba82a65b59d08dcf4e8076.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"[asy] draw((-1,-1)--(1,-1)--(1,1)--(-1,1)--cycle, black+linewidth(.75)); draw((0,-1)--(0,1), black+linewidth(.75)); draw((-1,0)--(1,0), black+linewidth(.75)); draw((-1,-1/sqrt(3))--(1,1/sqrt(3)), black+linewidth(.75)); draw((-1,1/sqrt(3))--(1,-1/sqrt(3)), black+linewidth(.75)); draw((-1/sqrt(3),-1)--(1/sqrt(3),1), black+linewidth(.75)); draw((1/sqrt(3),-1)--(-1/sqrt(3),1), black+linewidth(.75)); [/asy]\" width=\"252\" height=\"252\" />\n</p><p>Amy painted a dartboard over a square clock face using the \"hour positions\" as boundaries.[See figure.] If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/0/d/e0d2bf360290fd61d1c1557e763f2622363b3d35.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$t$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"8\" height=\"13\" /> is the area of one of the eight triangular regions such as that between 12 o'clock and 1 o'clock, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/6/1/0615acc3725de21025457e7d6f7694dab8e2f758.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$q$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"11\" height=\"13\" /> is the area of one of the four corner quadrilaterals such as that between 1 o'clock and 2 o'clock, then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/f/0/0f07d0b8a38645635b37fbb9d84d26391b1a66e0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{q}{t}=$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"31\" height=\"33\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/a/b/aab893fbaeae4cfac213e29800cb17fd2e8dfa27.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{(A) } 2\\sqrt{3}-2\\quad \\text{(B) } \\frac{3}{2}\\quad \\text{(C) } \\frac{\\sqrt{5}+1}{2}\\quad \\text{(D) } \\sqrt{3}\\quad \\text{(E) } 2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"391\" height=\"43\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1993_AHSME_Problems/Problem_17&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Assume the length of the side of the square is 2, WLOG.  This means the side of one t section is 1.  As the lines are at clock face positions, each section has a <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/5/6/6567a8cd8554799d84d07cbb303c64c45fb5ff20.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\tfrac{360}{12} = 30$\" style=\"vertical-align: -6px\" width=\"65\" height=\"21\" /> degree angle from the center.  So each section t is a <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/7/c/47c78b85058ee5e17f88e2cde302e48aad826b35.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$30-60-90$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"101\" height=\"15\" /> triangle with a long leg of 1.  Therefore, the short leg is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/6/5/c654e0984fe4ad0ee9d576ab1fa75088894496de.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\tfrac{1}{\\sqrt3}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -9px\" width=\"20\" height=\"23\" />.\n</p><p><br />\nThis makes the area of each <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/0/6/4069110bc1eded4d1da89b1a6313bfef8348e06e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$t = \\tfrac{1}{2}\\cdot b \\cdot h = \\tfrac{1}{2}\\cdot 1 \\cdot \\tfrac{1}{\\sqrt3} =  \\tfrac{1}{2\\sqrt3}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -9px\" width=\"228\" height=\"23\" />\n</p><p><br />\nThe total area comprises <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/8/c/f8c7199bec0d0ce0137117ffe6383ad646f25d1d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4q+8t$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"55\" height=\"16\" />, so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/6/7/e67682e0f26d2c39a309887ebeec6f6418e256bc.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[4q+(8\\cdot \\tfrac{1}{2\\sqrt3}) = 2^2=4\\]\" width=\"178\" height=\"24\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/c/1/cc1abdc155286a805afc51f6d85dd6967ba4dfb3.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[4q + \\tfrac{4}{\\sqrt3} = 4\\]\" width=\"94\" height=\"24\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/a/d/0adffec9dd6f644aa60fb8ddb659373c07339e8f.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[4q = 4 - \\tfrac{4}{\\sqrt3}\\]\" width=\"93\" height=\"24\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/6/a/76abddd899465005f603f00da07591eb97865cb8.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[q = 1 - \\tfrac{1}{\\sqrt3} = \\tfrac{\\sqrt3 - 1 }{\\sqrt3}\\]\" width=\"146\" height=\"27\" />\n</p><p><br />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/a/8/da8c428762dd57b48da718704c9dec8a8719c099.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\frac{q}{t} = \\frac{\\tfrac{\\sqrt3 - 1 }{\\sqrt3}}{\\tfrac{1}{2\\sqrt3}} = 2\\cdot (\\sqrt3 - 1) = \\boxed{2\\sqrt3-2}\\]\" width=\"294\" height=\"55\" />\n</p><p><br />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/8/6/386255c1da145bc497cf598169ccbaa210e8d0cf.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\fbox{A}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"24\" height=\"23\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1993_AHSME_Problems/Problem_17&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1993_AHSME\" title=\"1993 AHSME\">1993 AHSME</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1993_AHSME_Problems\" title=\"1993 AHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1993_AHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1993 AHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=44&amp;year=1993\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1993_AHSME_Problems/Problem_16\" title=\"1993 AHSME Problems/Problem 16\">Problem 16</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1993_AHSME_Problems/Problem_18\" title=\"1993 AHSME Problems/Problem 18\">Problem 18</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1993_AHSME_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"1993 AHSME Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1993_AHSME_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"1993 AHSME Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1993_AHSME_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"1993 AHSME Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1993_AHSME_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"1993 AHSME Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1993_AHSME_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"1993 AHSME Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1993_AHSME_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"1993 AHSME Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1993_AHSME_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"1993 AHSME Problems/Problem 7\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1993_AHSME_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"1993 AHSME Problems/Problem 8\">8</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1993_AHSME_Problems/Problem_9\" title=\"1993 AHSME Problems/Problem 9\">9</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1993_AHSME_Problems/Problem_10\" title=\"1993 AHSME Problems/Problem 10\">10</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1993_AHSME_Problems/Problem_11\" title=\"1993 AHSME Problems/Problem 11\">11</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1993_AHSME_Problems/Problem_12\" title=\"1993 AHSME Problems/Problem 12\">12</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1993_AHSME_Problems/Problem_13\" title=\"1993 AHSME Problems/Problem 13\">13</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1993_AHSME_Problems/Problem_14\" title=\"1993 AHSME Problems/Problem 14\">14</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1993_AHSME_Problems/Problem_15\" title=\"1993 AHSME Problems/Problem 15\">15</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1993_AHSME_Problems/Problem_16\" title=\"1993 AHSME Problems/Problem 16\">16</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">17</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1993_AHSME_Problems/Problem_18\" title=\"1993 AHSME Problems/Problem 18\">18</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1993_AHSME_Problems/Problem_19\" title=\"1993 AHSME Problems/Problem 19\">19</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1993_AHSME_Problems/Problem_20\" title=\"1993 AHSME Problems/Problem 20\">20</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1993_AHSME_Problems/Problem_21\" title=\"1993 AHSME Problems/Problem 21\">21</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1993_AHSME_Problems/Problem_22\" title=\"1993 AHSME Problems/Problem 22\">22</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1993_AHSME_Problems/Problem_23\" title=\"1993 AHSME Problems/Problem 23\">23</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1993_AHSME_Problems/Problem_24\" title=\"1993 AHSME Problems/Problem 24\">24</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1993_AHSME_Problems/Problem_25\" title=\"1993 AHSME Problems/Problem 25\">25</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1993_AHSME_Problems/Problem_26\" title=\"1993 AHSME Problems/Problem 26\">26</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1993_AHSME_Problems/Problem_27\" title=\"1993 AHSME Problems/Problem 27\">27</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1993_AHSME_Problems/Problem_28\" title=\"1993 AHSME Problems/Problem 28\">28</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1993_AHSME_Problems/Problem_29\" title=\"1993 AHSME Problems/Problem 29\">29</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1993_AHSME_Problems/Problem_30\" title=\"1993 AHSME Problems/Problem 30\">30</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"center\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=AHSME_Problems_and_Solutions\" title=\"AHSME Problems and Solutions\"> All AHSME Problems and Solutions</a></b>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<div class=\"print\">\n<div style=\"display:flex;width:100%;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center\">\n<div>\n<p><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=File:AMC_Logo.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/images/d/d1/AMC_Logo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"97\" height=\"84\" class=\"mw-file-element\" /></a></span>\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"flex-grow:1;text-align:right\">\n<p>These problems are copyrighted &#169; by the <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.maa.org\">Mathematical Association of America</a>. \n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n</div></div>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261017183602\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.036 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.060 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 148/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 2494/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 152/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 3/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 3571/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   12.918      1 -total\n 57.48%    7.425      1 Template:AHSME_box\n 39.98%    5.16